<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: DETAILS OF CZECH Q1-Q3 BALANCE OF PAYMENTS.</title>
<headline>DETAILS OF CZECH Q1-Q3 BALANCE OF PAYMENTS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank on</p>
<p>Thursday detailed the Czech Republic's balance of payments for</p>
<p>the first three quarters of 1996:</p>
<p>				   Q1-Q3/96    Q1-Q3/95	 FY 1995</p>
<p> CURRENT ACCOUNT ($ mln)   -3,082.7	-684.0	-1,362.3</p>
<p>   Trade Balance	     -4,118.4    -2,671.6	-3,677.9</p>
<p>     -exports		  16,061.9    10,189.7	21,462.5</p>
<p>     -imports		  20,180.3    12,861.3	25,140.4</p>
<p>   Balance of Services	1,129.1     1,530.6	 1,842.0</p>
<p>     revenues		   5,540.3     4,531.4	 6,717.8</p>
<p>	transport		   951.6     1,044.4	 1,460.5</p>
<p>	tourisim		  2,796.9     1,950.0	 2,875.2</p>
<p>	other services	  1,791.8     1,537.0	 2,382.1</p>
<p>     expenditure		4,411.2     3,000.8	 4,875.8</p>
<p>	transport		   506.8	 488.5	   799.3</p>
<p>	tourism		   2,025.3     1,150.0	 1,632.8</p>
<p>	other services	  1,879.1     1,362.3	 2,443.7</p>
<p>   Balance of income	   -483.1	 -10,8	  -105.6</p>
<p>	credit			895,0	 797,3	 1.194.5</p>
<p>	debit		     1.378,1	 808,1	 1.300.1</p>
<p>   Unrequitted transfers	389.7	 467.8	   579.2</p>
<p> CAPITAL ACCOUNT		2,023.2     5,263.5	 8,225.9</p>
<p>   Direct investment	    946.6     1,965.3	 2,525.6</p>
<p>    Czech invest. abroad	-25.8	 -18.9	   -36.6</p>
<p>    Foreign invest in CR	972.4     1,984.2	 2,562.2</p>
<p>   Portfolio investment	 413.4	 942.1	 1,362.0</p>
<p>   Other Capital		  663.2     2,251.7	 4,338.3</p>
<p>	 long-term		1,565.1     2,140.8	 3,367.1</p>
<p>	  assets		    -64.5	  43.7	    52.2</p>
<p>	  liabilities	   1,629.6     2,097.1	 3,314.9</p>
<p>	 short-term		-901.9	 215.3	   971.2</p>
<p>Errors, ommissions and</p>
<p> exchange rate differences    261.6     1,123.9	   594.5</p>
<p>Change in foreign exchange</p>
<p> reserves			   797.9    -5,703.4	-7,458.1</p>
<p>Note. Results are preliminary and subject to revision.</p>
<p>Resutlts for Q1-Q3 1996 use an exchange rate of 27.162</p>
<p>crowns/dollar, Q1-Q3 1995 use 26.57/dollar, and full-year 1995</p>
<p>use 26.53/dollar.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
